        <h2>2. Informational Purpose; No Professional Advice or Reliance</h2>
        <p>The site provides general informational, educational, fundraising, and community-engagement content. It does not provide legal, tax, investment, accounting, engineering, architectural, medical, safety, land-use, construction, or other professional advice. The NKU concept presently envisions sports fields and active-recreation facilities, a YMCA location with an aquatic center, indoor gym and childcare, trail and open-space connections, and related community amenities in North Kitsap. These are planning concepts only. No website language should be interpreted as a representation that NKU, the Club, the Foundation, or the YMCA Partner currently owns, controls, has contracted to acquire, or has secured any particular property unless expressly confirmed in a current, authorized written statement. A potential site, property ownership, acquisition discussions, site control, conservation outcomes, facility components, costs, schedules, designs, engineering, permitting, environmental review, financing, fundraising goals, public participation, partnerships, naming opportunities, and eventual operations may change, be phased, or may not occur. Do not make a decision or incur cost in reliance on preliminary website content without independent verification and appropriate professional advice.</p>
