        <li>impersonate another person or misrepresent authority, affiliation, a gift, pledge, license, insurance, qualification, or offer;</li>
        <li>submit sensitive personal or financial information through an unauthorized channel;</li>
        <li>use website names, marks, content, donor information, volunteer information, or contact information for commercial solicitation, fundraising not authorized by us, political campaigning, harassment, or data brokerage; or</li>
        <li>use the site in a manner that creates unreasonable risk or burden.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We may restrict, reject, preserve, disclose, or remove submissions; suspend access; and refer conduct to service providers, insurers, counsel, or authorities where we reasonably consider it appropriate. This does not create a duty to monitor all activity.</p>
