        <p>A volunteer or in-kind submission is an offer only and does not create acceptance, employment, compensation, a contract, agency, insurance coverage, access rights, or authority to act for the project. We or a project partner may accept, decline, limit, reassign, suspend, or end participation based on project needs, safety, qualifications, conduct, conflicts, supervision, insurance, screening, site rules, or other considerations.</p>
        <p>Work requiring a license, registration, permit, bond, insurance, professional standard, or specialized training may be performed only by appropriately qualified and authorized persons. Before participating, a person may be required to sign separate releases, waivers, confidentiality or media forms; provide proof of license, insurance, or background screening; complete safety training; and follow partner, contractor, site, youth-protection, and incident-reporting requirements. No website statement substitutes for those separate controls.</p>
